{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03581",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.34,
      "end_seconds": 4.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.24,
      "end_seconds": 11.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "So, come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.83,
      "end_seconds": 32.51,
      "duration_seconds": 19.68,
      "text": "yeah, it's a sore spot on the front of my shin i don't know what's causing it i did try to ignore it for a while i took the morning off to come in today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.17,
      "end_seconds": 36.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.26,
      "end_seconds": 40.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "it's been like this since Friday"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.05,
      "end_seconds": 52.65,
      "duration_seconds": 10.6,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.34,
      "end_seconds": 68.92,
      "duration_seconds": 15.58,
      "text": "Maybe a seven out of ten on a bad day. I'd say a couple of times a week. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.25,
      "end_seconds": 78.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.83,
      "end_seconds": 88.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.65,
      "end_seconds": 112.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "okay: temperature is 36.9 degrees, BP is 109 over 80, pulse is 82 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.54,
      "end_seconds": 118.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "alright, over here please and I'll take a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.87,
      "end_seconds": 122.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.37,
      "end_seconds": 138.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "There is a very localised tender spot on the bone and hopping on that leg hurts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.16,
      "end_seconds": 150.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "Okay, you can relax now. Let me check a few things. Any injury, numbness, swelling or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.04,
      "end_seconds": 156.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "I haven't had injury, numbness, swelling or fever, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.9,
      "end_seconds": 160.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.04,
      "end_seconds": 163.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.16,
      "end_seconds": 168.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Okay, anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.52,
      "end_seconds": 172.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.02,
      "end_seconds": 175.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.88,
      "end_seconds": 181.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.74,
      "end_seconds": 186.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.61,
      "end_seconds": 191.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.35,
      "end_seconds": 200.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.49,
      "end_seconds": 204.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Hmm, no, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.25,
      "end_seconds": 209.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.36,
      "end_seconds": 215.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Right, I had my tonsils removed as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.79,
      "end_seconds": 235.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.97,
      "end_seconds": 240.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.19,
      "end_seconds": 243.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.57,
      "end_seconds": 248.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.02,
      "end_seconds": 277.13,
      "duration_seconds": 13.11,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, this is probably a possible stress fracture rather than shin splints. That's my thinking for now, and it it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.07,
      "end_seconds": 299.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "I'll request a vitamin D level, it'll help with stress fracture"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.82,
      "end_seconds": 306.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "when would that take place?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.48,
      "end_seconds": 328.68,
      "duration_seconds": 20.2,
      "text": "Stop running, no impact exercise until the scan, swimming or cycling is fine. If it hasn't settled in a month, we'd think about an MRI of the shin, but not now. Let's review you after the scan. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.21,
      "end_seconds": 332.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.84,
      "end_seconds": 335.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}